# EXCEPTION: the five official checkpoints are committed deliberately.
# Per-seed results do not reproduce across machines (different hardware
# gives different weights from the same seed -- verified on two machines),
# so these files ARE the evidence for every per-seed number reported.
# 2.4 MB total. Do not remove.
!crn_5seed_final/seed_*/crn_best.pt

# CRN training output (checkpoints, heatmaps, loss curves)
crn_outputs*/
*_run.log

# Regenerated dataset copies from parameter sweeps -- bit-for-bit
# reproducible from generate_dataset.py + the documented seed in each
# sweep script, so not worth committing (confirmed 2026-09-12, see
# docs/TEAM_LOG.md). The lightweight CRN result files that live
# alongside these (history.json, loss_curve.png, sanity_check_heatmap.png)
# are NOT covered by this rule and should still be committed.
data_amp_*/

# Downloaded NHSI cubes (large, not redistributable)
data/
*.mat
NHSI dataset/

# OS
.DS_Store

